<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Generic Jenkins plugin: JSON-shaped, versioned configuration store (ConfigSet /
  ConfigSetVersion) persisted natively in $JENKINS_HOME, with structural validation and
  <code>#{Path}#</code> token substitution Pipeline steps
  (<code>configTemplateValidate</code>, <code>configTemplateSubstitute</code>), including
  build-version config pinning for safe rollback replay. Milestone 1 (MVP): persistence + pipeline
  steps only, driven from Pipeline scripts / Script Console — no Jelly configuration UI yet.
</div>
